# Room 3 — repair, retire, mint (locked 2026-09-14)

Do not mix waiting rooms. Do not mint a live letter from one or two tests.

**Repair (nucleus still that letter).** Detect still looks like the gene. Tactics slipped. Letter **stays live**. **Handle** can move **now** (prefer **limit** / wait-pullback — slippage first, not size). **Hunt** only after **two Bads on two names**. New extras sit in **Purgatoria** until the **same extra, same gene, three times**. Tactic repair (entries/exits) is not a new letter.

**Retire (nucleus gone).** Stop firing that letter. What still works is a **pack**, not a half-letter. Do **not** bolt it back onto the dead name.

**New pile (Room 2 Purgatory).** That pack sits. Same TF, ≥~85% vs a **live** letter → **joins that letter**. Same vs a pile already cooking → sits **beside it**. Matches nothing → own pile. **Third** similar pack + real DNA → new letter. Then Room 3 may fire it. Two failed letters are not glued unless the DNA matches.

Purgatory is unfinished clusters (not traded). Purgatoria is extras on a **live** gene. Room 3 never fires Purgatory.
